/goals-archive.md
/ideas.md
/experiences.md
/habits.md
/state.md
/agent-setup.md
/journal/
/learning/
/projects/

# Files an agent may create for itself during INSTALL.md
/CLAUDE.md
/GEMINI.md
/.claude/
/.gemini/

# OS clutter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
